      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-06",
        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 224 - 198, 2 Present (Roll no. 62). (text: 03/05/2025 CR H998)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-06",
        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On agreeing to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 224 - 198, 2 Present (Roll no. 62).",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-06",
        "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H1019-1020)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H. Res. 189, the Chair put the question on agreeing to the resolution and by voice vote announced that the ayes had prevailed. Mr. McGovern demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "The previous question was ordered without objection.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H. Res. 189.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "On motion to table Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 209 - 211, 1 Present (Roll no. 60).",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "Ms. Clark (MA) moved to table the measure.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "Considered as privileged matter. (consideration: CR H998-1004)",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "QUESTION OF THE PRIVILEGES OF THE HOUSE - Mr. Newhouse rose to a question of the privileges of the House and offered the resolution. The Chair directed the Clerk to report the resolution. Upon examination of the resolution, the Chair determined that the resolution did constitute a question of the privileges of the House.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "NOTIFICATION OF INTENT TO OFFER RESOLUTION - Mr. Newhouse notified the House of his intent to offer a privileged resolution pursuant to clause 2(a)(1) of rule IX. The Chair announced that a determination will be made at the time designated for consideration of the resolution.",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2025-03-05",
        "text": "Referred to the House Committee on Ethics.",
        "type": "IntroReferral"
      },
